WEBVTT

00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:02.920 line:88%
The balls are all there.

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:05.580 line:88%
So which shot is actually on?

00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:09.040 line:88%
This is Ghost Ball.

00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:13.120 line:88%
Snap the table,
and it finds your easiest pot.

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:16.670 line:88%
Hold your phone high over
the middle of the table,

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:21.130 line:88%
pointing straight down,
with all four corner pockets in frame.

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:26.700 line:88%
Ghost Ball finds the table’s edges,
flattens the perspective,

00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:30.540 line:88%
and picks out every ball on
the cloth, including the white.

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:36.290 line:88%
Then it checks every possible
pot and shows you the best one.

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:39.740 line:88%
Aim the white’s centre
at the dashed ghost ball.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:43.110 line:88%
That’s exactly where the
white sits at contact.

00:00:43.630 --> 00:00:45.930 line:88%
The blue dot is where the balls meet,

00:00:45.970 --> 00:00:49.150 line:88%
and the orange line follows
the ball into the pocket.

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:53.910 line:88%
It even tells you where
to strike the white,

00:00:53.950 --> 00:00:58.600 line:88%
and traces where the white goes next,
so you’re not caught out by an in-off.

00:01:00.950 --> 00:01:02.450 line:88%
Snookered?

00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:05.870 line:88%
It checks banks, kicks and combinations,

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:09.480 line:88%
and ranks every other pot
from most to least likely.

00:01:10.950 --> 00:01:14.010 line:88%
Pick your table,
your colour and your level,

00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:16.910 line:88%
and the odds adjust to
how you actually play.

00:01:18.850 --> 00:01:20.350 line:88%
Missed something?

00:01:20.610 --> 00:01:24.710 line:88%
Fix the corners, add a ball,
or tap the white yourself.

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:28.650 line:88%
Ghost Ball.

00:01:28.830 --> 00:01:30.940 line:88%
Know your shot before you take it.
